//! The `text-size-adjust` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSS) property
//! controls the text inflation algorithm used on some smartphones and tablets. Other browsers will
//! ignore this property.
//!
//! Initial: autoForSmartphoneBrowsersSupportingInflation. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: yes, refer to the corresponding size of the text font.
//!
